# UNDERDELVE: the Deep Gate stays shut without the Brass Key and opens with it;
# the Lantern Keeper sells lanterns for 100 ore.
game underdelve
wait 10
press A
wait 5
cheat room 3 5 200 130
cheat no_gloom
wait 5
hold RIGHT 40
expect gate_open == 0
expect room_x == 3
cheat dismiss
cheat give 16
hold RIGHT 30
expect gate_open == 1
cheat dismiss
hold RIGHT 100
expect room_x == 4
cheat room 2 5 210 130
cheat lanterns 3
cheat money 250
wait 5
press UP
expect lanterns == 4
expect money == 150
press UP
expect lanterns == 5
expect money == 50
press UP
expect lanterns == 5
